{
  "slug": "xcode-cloud",
  "name": "Xcode Cloud",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Apple Xcode Cloud CI/CD integration. Monitor builds, diagnose failures, trigger workflows, and manage your iOS/macOS CI pipeline directly from Claude Code. Provides 21 MCP tools, 7 skills, and 3 specialized agents for build analysis, pipeline optimization, and flaky test detection, all powered by the App Store Connect API.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **7 skills**, **3 agents**, **1 hook** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (7): `analyze-builds` (Analyze Xcode Cloud build health and trends), `check-builds` (Check Xcode Cloud CI build status), `compare-builds` (Compare two Xcode Cloud builds side by side), `diagnose-failure` (Diagnose Xcode Cloud build failures), `setup` (Set up Apple App Store Connect API credentials for Xcode Cloud), `trigger-build` (Trigger a new Xcode Cloud build for a workflow), `watch-build` (Watch a running Xcode Cloud build until it completes)\n- **Agents** (3): `build-failure-analyst` (Deep analysis of Xcode Cloud build failures), `ci-pipeline-advisor` (Analyzes Xcode Cloud CI/CD pipeline configuration and build history to recommend workflow improvements and identify flaky tests), `flaky-test-detector` (Detects flaky tests by analyzing test results across multiple Xcode Cloud builds)\n- **Hooks** (1): `PreToolUse`\n- **MCP servers** (1): `xcode-cloud`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install xcode-cloud@claude-community` from `JamalBelilet/xcode-cloud-plugin`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 7,
    "agent": 3,
    "hook": 1,
    "mcp": 1
  },
